              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "blessedcjc"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used 2 Tbsp lime juice in lieu of the real lime, dried Cilantro, &amp; 1 Tbsp Knorr's Chicken Flavored Boullion, and mixed all of the ingredients together before adding 2 bags of 10 ounce Green Giant Riced Cauliflower. However, my dish yielded 6-1/2 Cup servings instead of 4. It was great.",
