            "reviewBody": "Yes!!!!!!! I love it! I made it in the pan, on high heat with a little bit of coconut oil , and added a little shallot, and green onion with a dash of garlic. BOMB!!!!!",
            "datePublished": "2015-04-01T23:14:20.100Z"
